                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl">
                    <span class="text-yellow-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase">ZAR/USD</span>
                    <span class="text-white font-black">~R16.86/$</span>
                    <span class="text-red-400 text-xs">↑ EM Flight</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl">
                    <span class="text-yellow-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase">Under-Recovery</span>
                    <span class="text-white font-black">R7.00/l</span>
                    <span class="text-red-400 text-xs">Diesel (mid-month)</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-red-600/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 -mt-16 relative z-20">

        <!-- April 1 Double Hit Banner -->
        <div class="mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-900 to-orange-900 text-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-red-700/50 shadow-lg">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                    <div class="bg-red-500/30 p-3 rounded-xl">
                        <i data-lucide="flame" class="text-red-300 w-6 h-6"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-red-300 mb-0.5">⚠ The April 1 Double-Hit — New Intel</div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-white/90 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                            Eskom's <strong>8.76% electricity tariff hike</strong> lands on the exact same day as the fuel surge — April 1, 2026. The simultaneous squeeze on both energy inputs represents the largest single-day disposable income shock in recent history.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
