                <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">+R7.50/l</div>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-auto italic">CEF mid-month; worst case >R8.00/l if trend holds.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Card 2 -->
