                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Brent crude surged from $69 in February to over $103/bbl in March, driven by US-Iran hostilities. Strait of Hormuz risks remain high.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-3">
                    <i data-lucide="activity" class="text-blue-500 w-5 h-5"></i>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-sm">Rand Weakness</h4>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Safe-haven flight saw the rand slip to R16.86/$. Every 10c move in the exchange rate shifts the pump price by 6–10c/l.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-3">
                    <i data-lucide="shield" class="text-green-600 w-5 h-5"></i>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-sm">Civil Action Pressure</h4>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Major civil action groups calling for a repeat of the 2022 R1.50/l temporary GFL reduction. Precedent exists, but no commitment yet.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-8">

                <!-- Business Operational Impact -->
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-6">
                        <i data-lucide="briefcase" class="text-blue-600"></i>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Business Operational Impact</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                                <div class="bg-blue-50 p-2 rounded-lg text-blue-600 mt-1 shrink-0">
                                    <i data-lucide="truck" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-bold">The 30% Rule</h4>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Logistics fuel accounts for ~35% of total ops. This hike increases segment costs by <span class="text-red-600 font-semibold">25–30% overnight</span>.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                                <div class="bg-orange-50 p-2 rounded-lg text-orange-600 mt-1 shrink-0">
                                    <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-bold">The 14-Day Surcharge</h4>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Expect a 5%–10% fuel surcharge from couriers within 14 days of implementation.</p>
