                            </div>
                            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                                <h5 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1 text-indigo-900">Value Migration</h5>
                                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Projected 15% shift from "Premier" to single-club models to cut R300–R500 from monthly spend.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-4 bg-yellow-50 rounded-xl border border-yellow-100">
                                <h5 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1 text-yellow-900">The Electricity Compressor</h5>
