                                <p class="text-xs text-orange-800 italic">"Consumers will be worse off unless incomes rise" — gym spend is often first to go.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Strategic Recommendations -->
                <div class="bg-indigo-600 text-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden">
