                            <p class="text-[11px] text-red-700 mt-1">Squeeze on a typical household. Exceeds average gym cost by ~2x.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 bg-orange-50 rounded-2xl border border-orange-100">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-orange-900 mb-1 text-sm">The 14-Day Food Lag</h4>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-orange-800 leading-relaxed">Shelf prices track fuel with a 2–4 week delay. Mid-April will see food spike.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
